"},"say:18:1220240011:1":{"text":"我一直想在那天打扮得体面一些，至少不要太难闻……","source_cn":"我一直想在那天打扮得体面一些，至少不要太难闻……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3ADE7B498CCF341A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1220240012:1":{"text":"我也清楚，用以前那种水，不管怎么洗，身上都会有腥味的。","source_cn":"我也清楚，用以前那种水，不管怎么洗，身上都会有腥味的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3D959F4F198E405D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1220240013:1":{"text":"但，没想到，现在这些水……不光可以好好洗漱，还能用来喝……呜呜呜……","source_cn":"但，没想到，现在这些水……不光可以好好洗漱，还能用来喝...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7C12D5131A2A1227","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1220240014:1":{"text":"安格妮小姐一定会是全锈锚港最漂亮的新娘子的！","source_cn":"安格妮小姐一定会是全锈锚港最漂亮的新娘子的！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA7D654BEE0A8ABB6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1220240015:1":{"text":"是、是的，谢谢你，使魔小姐！我一定会成为最漂亮的新娘……","source_cn":"是、是的，谢谢你，使魔小姐！我一定会成为最漂亮的新娘……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5C4164ABB3688434","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1220240016:1":{"text":"这都是多亏了您，谢谢您，矮人师傅，您真是全世界最最伟大的工匠！","source_cn":"这都是多亏了您，谢谢您，矮人师傅，您真是全世界最最伟大...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x82870A6EDF5DBAC4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1220240017:1":{"text":"我结婚的时候，一定会给您发请柬！","source_cn":"我结婚的时候，一定会给您发请柬！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFE2F722EAED79F5F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:25:1220240018:1":{"text":"哇哈哈哈哈！好啊！我到时候一定会去的！","source_cn":"哇哈哈哈哈！好啊！我到时候一定会去的！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9CCD3E440A3A43DF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:安格妮":{"text":"安格妮","source":"安格妮","status":"source"},"speaker:呼金":{"text":"呼金","source":"呼金","status":"source"},"speaker:漫漫":{"text":"漫漫","source":"漫漫","status":"source"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":19,"localized_text_count":18,"speaker_count":3}}